  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilient Inclusive and accountable Communities in Zimbabwe (BRIC- Zim)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam will work with local civil society and community -based organisations (CSOs/CBOs) who have an ongoing relationship and have convening power to identify and engage with vulnerable, marginalised and poor members of the target communities. Utilising Oxfam Zimbabwe&apos;s humanitarian action experience and its convening power, Oxfam will use a community -based participatory vulnerability ranking to identify vulnerable households (HHs).</narrative>
  </description>
